                "title": "function evaluateRecordFreshness",
                "description": "Evaluates whether a media entity record is still fresh in the local database. Rules: - If record does not exist or has no updatedAt -> stale (must fetch). - If record is an unhydrated stub (missing provider sync timestamp) -> stale (must fetch initial payload). - Finished/Ended/Released/Published/Cancelled -> fresh unless ≥ 3 calendar months old. - Releasing/Upcoming/In Production/Unknown etc. -> fresh unless ≥ 7 calendar days old. - Date comparison normalizes both dates to start-of-day (ignoring time).",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "id": "exp_evaluateRecordFreshness_0_1",
                    "kind": "selection",
                    "title": "`!record || !record.updatedAt`",
                    "selectionMode": "if_else",
